1
00:00:00,610 --> 00:00:02,140
(Penny:)I can't believe
you're seeing someone

2
00:00:02,145 --> 00:00:03,275
(Penny:)and we don't even know about it.

3
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:05,210
(Bernadette:)Yeah, why wouldn't
you tell us?

4
00:00:05,215 --> 00:00:06,645
(Amy:)Because it's new and weird

5
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:08,920
(Amy:)and I'm just trying
to figure it all out.

6
00:00:08,919 --> 00:00:09,989
(Amy:)And I knew

7
00:00:09,986 --> 00:00:11,586
(Amy:)if I told you guys
I had been out

8
00:00:11,588 --> 00:00:13,658
(Amy:)with a few people that you'd get
way too excited about it.

9
00:00:13,657 --> 00:00:14,557
(Stuart:)A few people?

10
00:00:14,558 --> 00:00:16,588
What?!
Amy! - Amy!

11
00:00:17,527 --> 00:00:20,097
(Stuart:)So, are we allowed to ask
how it's going?

12
00:00:20,096 --> 00:00:21,496
(Amy:)It's going fine.

13
00:00:21,498 --> 00:00:23,828
(Amy:)It's mostly just been
meeting people for coffee.

14
00:00:23,834 --> 00:00:26,804
Wha...?!

15
00:00:26,803 --> 00:00:28,203
(Raj:)I thought we
were all...

16
00:00:28,205 --> 00:00:30,175
(Raj:)Never mind.

17
00:00:31,007 --> 00:00:32,507
I-I thought you
weren't ready

18
00:00:32,509 --> 00:00:33,979
(Bernadette:)to start seeing people.

19
00:00:33,977 --> 00:00:35,847
(Amy:)Well, I don't have
much experience dating,

20
00:00:35,846 --> 00:00:37,716
(Amy:)so I decided
it would be good for me

21
00:00:37,714 --> 00:00:39,344
(Amy:)to, you know,
get out there a little.

22
00:00:39,349 --> 00:00:41,219
(Penny:)Well, good for you.

23
00:00:41,218 --> 00:00:43,148
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

24
00:00:43,153 --> 00:00:45,053
(Bernadette:)And how many guys
have you gone out with?

25
00:00:45,055 --> 00:00:46,225
(Stuart:)Please be less than two.

26
00:00:46,223 --> 00:00:48,093
(Man:)Three.
Damn it.

27
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:54,000
(Sheldon:)Well, the Swedes
might beat us,

28
00:00:53,997 --> 00:00:59,027
(Sheldon:)but at least we won't get
gang-noogied in prison.

